title: "Predicting the need for broad-spectrum empiric antibiotics at hospital admission: analysis code"
abstract: "Analysis code for a retrospective cohort study in MIMIC-IV v3.0 predicting receipt of three or more antibiotic classes within 24 hours of admission using data available in the first six hours."
